**Classification of Data Structures:**
```
                    Data Structures
                          │
          ┌───────────────┴───────────────┐
          │                               │
    Primitive                       Non-Primitive
    (int, float, char, bool)              │
                              ┌───────────┴───────────┐
                              │                       │
                           Linear                 Non-Linear
                   (Array, LinkedList,          (Tree, Graph,
                    Stack, Queue)                Hash Table)
```

**Why Data Structures Matter:**
- **Efficiency**: Choose right structure = faster operations
- **Organization**: Logical data management
- **Reusability**: Standard solutions to common problems
- **Memory optimization**: Minimize space usage

**Time Complexity Comparison:**

| Operation | Array | Linked List | Stack | Queue | Hash Table | Tree (balanced) |
|-----------|-------|-------------|-------|-------|------------|-----------------|
| Access | O(1) | O(n) | O(n) | O(n) | O(1) avg | O(log n) |
| Search | O(n) | O(n) | O(n) | O(n) | O(1) avg | O(log n) |
| Insert | O(n) | O(1)* | O(1) | O(1) | O(1) avg | O(log n) |
| Delete | O(n) | O(1)* | O(1) | O(1) | O(1) avg | O(log n) |

